### Health (start RetailCore first: mvn spring-boot:run)
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Existing sample order (default H2 mode includes seed rows)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1

### Admin HTML page
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/orders

### Create a test order (modifies stock; gateway may simulate timeouts)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CustomerEmail": "jane@example.com",
  "ShippingRegion": "CA",
  "Lines": [{"ProductId": 1, "Quantity": 1}],
  "CardNumber": "4242424242424242"
}

### Missing order
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/999999
